      "headline": "Senior Research Software Developer @ UCL",
      "about": "Senior Research Software Developer within the UCL Centre for Advanced Research Computing, contributing to cutting-edge machine learning (ML) software solutions with over 5 years of experience in research software development. Focused on advancing ML workflows, MLOps pipelines, and NLP methodologies, particularly within healthcare and social science domains. Recent projects include implementing end-to-end ML pipelines for text classification in social sciences and developing data science platforms to enable ML-powered pipelines in forecasting hospital bed demand.\n\nAt UCL, collaborated with multidisciplinary teams to design scalable solutions leveraging tools like Python, PyTorch, Apache Airflow, MLFlow, and Docker. Passionate about optimising model performance and applying ML in non-traditional domains to drive impactful research outcomes. Dedicated to empowering researchers through robust software engineering practices and fostering innovation in the intersection of technology and healthcare.",
