                  "text": "A collimation system for a fast neutron generator was designed and built. The generator uses Deuterium-Tritium fusion to create an isotropic source of neutrons, shielding was to be designed such that neutrons are only permitted to escape in a V shape above the generator, with neutrons elsewhere absorbed by the shielding."
